What this app is (30-second brain reload)
-----------------------------------------
PyQt6 desktop hydrology tool. Pulls time series from USBR/HDB (API + Oracle),
AQUARIUS, and USGS NWIS. Local catalog in core/bunker.db. Overlay/delta compare,
QAQC colors, quick looks, optional SQL tab, CSV export, keyring creds.
Entry: DataDoctor.py. Guts: core/. Pretty buttons: ui/.


