Confirmed FIXED by Seifer (do not re-fix unless something regressed)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
[x] End timestamps exclusive end (HOUR end on the hour dropped last point)
    -> core/Query.py buildTimestamps: while current <= end
[x] BOP/EOP Options radios not wired to Config.periodOffset
    -> Utils.resolvePeriodOffset + Options save writes both hourTimestampMethod
       and periodOffset (EOP=True, BOP=False)
[x] Header sort / Undo smashed Overlay formatting
    -> sort captures UserRole + colors; restore after sort (no rebuild wipe)
[x] QAQC vs Overlay fight club
    -> overlay merges first, then QAQC on final display, then overlay color
       overrides only for mismatch/missing (delta==0 keeps QAQC)
[x] Password paste while masked = chaos
    -> customPasswordEdit now uses Qt native EchoMode.Password / Normal
       (no more dual realText + fake bullets). Brief "show last typed char" is GONE.
[x] Export complete message
    -> success QMessageBox after CSV write


RE-FIXED this session (2026-07-23) — Seifer still needs to re-test
------------------------------------------------------------------
[ ] Export CSV respects active tab (Data Query mainTable vs SQL sqlTable)
    ROOT CAUSE: used `currentWidget is sqlTab` after findChild — identity missed
    SQL tab, so export always used mainTable (empty → "no data"; with data → wrong tab).
    FIX: store self.tabSQL; detect via objectName == 'tabSQL' and/or tab index.
    File: DataDoctor.py btnExportCSVPressed

[ ] HDB headers: commonName - dataType (not commonName alone)
    ROOT CAUSE: getColByName looked for exact "dataType"; bunker.db column /
    table header is "datatype" (lowercase). Lookup returned -1 → baseLabel only.
    FIX: getColByName is case-insensitive; uiSearch uses 'datatype'.
    Files: core/Query.py getColByName; ui/uiSearch.py

Also still in code but not re-confirmed:
[ ] Large dataset warning removed (>10k row Yes/No dialog gone from buildTable)
[ ] Header sort not stacked (sectionClicked no longer re-connected every query)

